fixture landing_no_lag
doc BUILD.md s5 Jump: "Landing: 0 f of lag; a 3 f squash animation that does not block input"
room test/flat
frames 50
input
  0..5 jump R
  6..49 R
end
expect
  mark land 1..49 event.land=1
  # The run carries straight through the landing frame at full speed.
  during land-2..land+5 vx=2304
  at land x=2304+x@(land-1)
  at land+1 x=2304+x@land
end
